    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Is ITD GrowthLabs a jewelry-specialist agency or a generic D2C agency?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Jewelry is a named vertical for us. We have the <a href=\"/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php\">Fabelia D2C jewelry case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks, a <a href=\"/faqs/d2c-jewellery.php\">D2C jewelry FAQ hub</a>, and city-specific jewelry agency pages across Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru, Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Jeddah, Doha, Dammam, and Al Khobar. Jewelry is not a category we handle occasionally &mdash; it is a category we have depth in."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Which jewelry sub-verticals do you specialise in?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Fine jewelry (gold + diamond), fashion jewelry (silver + stone), bridal + wedding, lab-grown diamond, men's jewelry, kids + baby, lifestyle + everyday, and Arabic-market gold + attar-adjacent. We tune the funnel to sub-vertical &mdash; fine jewelry has 45-90 day cycles + WhatsApp + video consultation dominant; fashion jewelry has 3-14 day cycles + Meta + Instagram + influencer dominant. Different playbooks."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you work with jewelry brands only in India or also GCC + international?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "India + GCC as core markets. Existing city-specific jewelry marketing pages across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Jeddah, Doha, Dammam, Al Khobar (GCC) + Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru, Chennai, Kolkata (India). We support Arabic + Hindi + English creative production, INR + AED + SAR pricing, halal-compliant messaging, and calendar-aware campaigns (Ramadan + Eid + Dhanteras + Akshaya Tritiya + wedding seasons)."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is a realistic marketing budget for a D2C jewelry brand?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Rs 1.5-3.5 lakh / month all-in for founder-led boutique jewelry (Rs 25L-2 Cr revenue). Rs 4-12 lakh for mid-market (Rs 2-25 Cr). Rs 12-30 lakh+ for enterprise + multi-region. Ad spend on top of retainer &mdash; typical Rs 50K-Rs 5 lakh / month for boutique, Rs 3-15 lakh / month for mid-market, Rs 10-40 lakh+ / month for enterprise + luxury."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do you handle high-value jewelry conversion + trust?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Different funnel from low-ticket D2C. WhatsApp + video consultation for personal-shopping, showroom-to-online integration, wishlist + concierge automation, 45-90 day nurture sequences for high-consideration buyers, trust + certification (BIS + HUID + hallmarking) display at every touchpoint, bridal + gift-occasion campaigns, and celebrity + luxury influencer content that shifts brand perception. Not just performance ad spend."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you build the Shopify or WooCommerce site too?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Jewelry-specific Shopify + WooCommerce builds &mdash; 360&deg; product views, AR try-on, video-first product pages, size + fit guides, BIS + HUID compliance display, high-value payment gateway (higher transaction limits, EMI, wallet), insurance-integrated checkout, wishlist + video consultation, WhatsApp Cloud API. Sites take 4-10 weeks depending on scope. Cost Rs 3-15 lakh."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What about influencer + UGC marketing for jewelry?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Core capability. Micro + mid-tier + celebrity creator sourcing, bridal + wedding blogger networks (India + GCC), UGC rights management + amplification into paid. Categories: bridal, festive, fashion, everyday, luxury, streetwear-adjacent (for men's + lab-grown). We handle brief-to-content-to-amplification end-to-end."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long before we see meaningful revenue lift?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "First qualified enquiries + paid conversions within 2-3 weeks of launch. Meaningful monthly-revenue lift by month 3. SEO-driven organic compounding from month 4-6. Full brand + funnel maturity by month 9-12. Bridal + festive-season peaks (Dhanteras, Akshaya Tritiya, wedding season, Ramadan, Eid) drive concentrated revenue spikes that our calendar-aware planning is tuned for."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Which is more important for jewelry D2C &mdash; Google Ads, Meta Ads, or SEO?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "All three, weighted by sub-vertical + stage. Fine jewelry: 40% Meta + 30% Google + 15% Instagram organic + 15% SEO + WhatsApp. Fashion jewelry: 45% Meta + Instagram + 25% Google + 20% influencer + 10% SEO. Bridal: 35% Meta + 25% content + video + 20% influencer + 20% SEO + WhatsApp. Lab-grown: 40% Google Search + 30% content + 20% Meta + 10% LinkedIn light-touch. Different mix per archetype."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do we start &mdash; what does the first call cover?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Book a free 30-minute discovery call via our Calendly. We map your existing funnel + brand + collection + revenue + goals + share a customised proposal within 3 working days. Or WhatsApp us at +91-9930950940 with your Shopify URL or Instagram handle + current monthly ad spend + we send back a 1-page audit within 24 hours."}}]}</script>
